# Theorist's Sanctum: "you may behold a Jace. If you don't, this land enters tapped" (CR 614.12a). Bot1 has a Jace to behold
# and chooses none: the land enters tapped and nothing is revealed. The scenario beside it (beholding from the hand) is the
# control: the same hand, the other answer, and an untapped land.

[Bot1 Deck]
Theorist's Sanctum
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Island x5
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Sanctum.Play
Bot1.Choose()

[Expect]
